{"id": "P1", "source_run": "sim-r5", "at": "2026-11-17T21:00:40+0800", "situation": "競爭者網域首頁是運動或資訊內容，sitemap 有一個佔約一半網址的資料夾，內容是大量商業關鍵字（品牌名加意圖詞）頁，另有一個大量日更模板文章資料夾；網域可能是舊站改作新用途。需判斷關鍵字頁規模、是否模板化、導流目標，以及網域歷史。", "route": "1. sitemap_tree：build 後 search 指定關鍵字並 sample 大資料夾，因為能看出關鍵字頁集中處、佔比與網址型態。\n2. inspect_page：讀列表頁與兩個品牌頁的 headings 與 JSON-LD，因為逐頁比對才知 H2、FAQ 是否同模板，title 也要逐頁看。\n3. inspect_page：用 part=links 加 link_filter 篩推廣網域與站內連結，因為只有連結清單看得到 rel 與外部主機。\n4. wayback：timeline 後 snapshot 轉址前最後正常存檔並讀，因為能證明舊用途，再對照 JSON-LD 日期與註冊日。", "result": "照走", "avoid_reason": "", "paired_id": "", "evidence_ids": ["E-0100", "E-0103", "E-0105", "E-0107", "E-0109", "E-0116", "E-0120", "E-0114", "E-0118", "E-0119"], "route_tools": [{"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0100"], "call_n": 1}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0103"], "call_n": 3}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0105"], "call_n": 5}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0107"], "call_n": 6}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/富遊娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0109"], "call_n": 7}, {"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0114"], "call_n": 9}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0116"], "call_n": 10}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "web.archive.org", "path": "/web/20251108182921id_/https://2030.tw/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0114", "E-0118"], "call_n": 11}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0119"], "call_n": 13}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0120"], "call_n": 14}]}
